---

This Unity port is based on the original AestheticFluidBg.js effect from:
https://github.com/Rockiez/color4bg.js

The original JavaScript implementation uses WebGL shaders, which have been
translated to Unity's HLSL/CG shader language for compatibility with Unity's
rendering pipeline.